First boot of the A/B image on hardware, 2026-10-28, image built from bbb2f49
(sdcard.img, factory image: only slot A eligible). Console capture by the user; the
bracketed prefix is the capturing terminal's own clock (UTC+7).

EXCERPT: the lines that bear on T046 (ota-clock) and T027 (ota-health). The kernel messages
between 0.000 and 4.7 s and the device-driver noise are omitted, nothing else is edited.

